+2 does not always get you +2.  The odds are pretty good that it will,
but the only certain enchantment you can get on wished-for items is +1.
  If you're into stochastic methods, +3 gives you the best long-term
enchantment results.  What I mean by this is that the yield of wishing
for +3 many many times, when all the actual bonuses you get are added
up, will be slightly higher than the yield wishing for +2 the same
number of times.

Be prepared, in any case, for the RNG to decide that you get +0
whichever way you decide to wish, because it can ;)

